OL,3,COliver Glasner confirmed as Forest's
OL,4,Cfifth head coach in less than a year
OL,6,FNottingham Forest have confirmed the
OL,7,Fappointment of Oliver Glasner as their
OL,8,Fnew head coach.
OL,10,FGlasner won the FA Cup and most
OL,11,Frecently the Europa Conference League
OL,12,Flast season with Crystal Palace.
OL,14,FThe Austrian becomes Nottingham
OL,15,FForest's fifth head coach in less than
OL,16,F12 months.
