OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783673336
OL,3,COliver Glasner confirmed as Forest's
OL,4,Cfifth head coach in less than a year
OL,6,FIn a statement the clubs owner,
OL,7,FEvangelos Marinakis said: "In our
OL,8,Fdiscussions with Oliver, it was clear
OL,9,Fthat we share the same vision, the
OL,10,Fsame ambition and the same relentless
OL,11,Fdesire to succeed.
OL,13,F"He has consistently demonstrated
OL,14,Fthroughout his career that he can
OL,15,Fbuild outstanding teams and deliver
OL,16,Fsuccess against the strongest
OL,17,Fcompetition.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783673336
OL,3,COliver Glasner confirmed as Forest's
OL,4,Cfifth head coach in less than a year
OL,6,F"It has always been our goal to
OL,7,Festablish Nottingham Forest once again
OL,8,Famong the leading clubs in England and
OL,9,FEurope.
OL,11,F"Our ambition is not simply to compete
OL,12,F` our ambition is to win, to challenge
OL,13,Ffor major honours and to create a
OL,14,Ffootball club that our supporters can
OL,15,Fbe proud of for many years to come.
OL,17,F"Oliver is a winner. He has earned
OL,18,Fsuccess through his leadership, his
OL,19,Fpersonality and the style of football
OL,20,Fhis teams play.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783673336
OL,3,COliver Glasner confirmed as Forest's
OL,4,Cfifth head coach in less than a year
OL,6,F"We believe he is the right person to
OL,7,Flead us into this next chapter, and I
OL,8,Fam delighted to welcome Oliver to the
OL,9,FClub."
OL,11,FMeanwhile Oliver Glasner said: "I'm
OL,12,Fdelighted to join Nottingham Forest as
OL,13,Fhead coach.
OL,15,F"From my very first conversations with
OL,16,Fthe owner and the leadership team, it
OL,17,Fwas evident to me that they have a
OL,18,Fclear vision for this football club
OL,19,Fand complete trust and belief in me
OL,20,Fand my staff to build a strong future
OL,21,Ftogether over the long term.
OL,26,@qD@FO]sD@`OU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783673336
OL,3,COliver Glasner confirmed as Forest's
OL,4,Cfifth head coach in less than a year
OL,6,F"That trust and shared commitment,
OL,7,Ftogether with the potential that I see
OL,8,Fwithin the squad, were key factors for
OL,9,Fme and I am excited about what we can
OL,10,Fachieve together."
OL,12,FHe adds: "Nottingham Forest is a club
OL,13,Fwith incredible prestige and history,
OL,14,Fa two-time European Champion with one
OL,15,Fof the most passionate fan bases in
OL,16,Ffootball.
OL,18,F"Our aim is to build a team that can
OL,19,Fhelp take the club to the next level
OL,20,Fin the years ahead and that our
OL,21,Fsupporters can be proud of.
OL,26,@tD@JOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783673336
OL,3,COliver Glasner confirmed as Forest's
OL,4,Cfifth head coach in less than a year
OL,6,F"My immediate focus is on meeting the
OL,7,Fplayers and staff and getting to work
OL,8,Fas we begin pre-season. I'm excited
OL,9,Ffor the future and will work
OL,10,Ftirelessly to represent this great
OL,11,Fclub with pride and to bring success
OL,12,Fon the pitch. I can't wait to get
OL,13,Fstarted."
OL,15,FGlasner, 51, was appointed following
OL,16,Fthe sacking of Vitor Pereira on
OL,17,FThursday 2 June.
OL,19,FIn a statement, the Brazilian said he
OL,20,Fwas taken by 'complete surprise and
OL,21,Fwithout any warning'.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@IO]
