OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783673336
OL,3,COliver Glasner confirmed as Forest's
OL,4,Cfifth head coach in less than a year
OL,6,FHe left Forest after a turbulent
OL,7,Fseason at the club, which also saw
OL,8,Fthem managed by Nuno Espirito Santo,
OL,9,FAnge Postecoglou and Sean Dyche.
OL,11,FIn a statement, Forest said they
OL,12,Fwanted to place on record their
OL,13,F'sincere thanks to Vitor and his team
OL,14,Ffor their hard work and commitment
OL,15,Fthroughout their time at the club.'
